    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/4fa99c37df612fcb9c3865b78aa9ed03.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by arcade classics like Bubble Bobble and Snow Bros, Wispy Dreams delivers a modernized take on the beloved genre that fans have been waiting for. Bash enemies into each other with a variety of kicks, and watch your score soar as you chain them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/fa76c7c3e571a9530a548c67bc7db3dc.poster.avif?t=1750869101\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/fa76c7c3e571a9530a548c67bc7db3dc.webm?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/fa76c7c3e571a9530a548c67bc7db3dc.mp4?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/4c8dc74cbe9bb198457952cefbd4e682.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wispy Isles are in danger! A mysterious force is taking over the minds and spirits of all the land's creatures. Those you call &quot;Guardians&quot; have been powerless to stop it. Looks like it's up to you to restore harmony to the Isles, and perhaps make some friends along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/75e9bcdd0a80ddb4e3fbd4e5294fca80.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name of the game is to clear all the enemies on the screen to continue. But there's a twist - a magical key will appear and reawaken your foes. Bring it to the Gear Lock in time, or else you might get a visit from a not so friendly face. If you make it all the way to the world's boss, brace yourself for a tough fight. But wait, have you found all the secret items along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/97e1067d42cb3a2b91f803cee30728cf.poster.avif?t=1750869101\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/97e1067d42cb3a2b91f803cee30728cf.webm?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/97e1067d42cb3a2b91f803cee30728cf.mp4?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/472f1155a30424fc2897ed788e8fc6bc.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 worlds to explore  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 20 enemies to pummel  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 9 bosses to fight  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 endings to discover  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of powerups to collect   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of secrets to find   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate difficulties and game modes to unlock   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly hand drawn artwork and animation   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful and varied orchestral soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/41526d0fc5c5ea5f137a654ed3d4ed16.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/4fa99c37df612fcb9c3865b78aa9ed03.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by arcade classics like Bubble Bobble and Snow Bros, Wispy Dreams delivers a modernized take on the beloved genre that fans have been waiting for. Bash enemies into each other with a variety of kicks, and watch your score soar as you chain them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/fa76c7c3e571a9530a548c67bc7db3dc.poster.avif?t=1750869101\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/fa76c7c3e571a9530a548c67bc7db3dc.webm?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/fa76c7c3e571a9530a548c67bc7db3dc.mp4?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/4c8dc74cbe9bb198457952cefbd4e682.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wispy Isles are in danger! A mysterious force is taking over the minds and spirits of all the land's creatures. Those you call &quot;Guardians&quot; have been powerless to stop it. Looks like it's up to you to restore harmony to the Isles, and perhaps make some friends along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/75e9bcdd0a80ddb4e3fbd4e5294fca80.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name of the game is to clear all the enemies on the screen to continue. But there's a twist - a magical key will appear and reawaken your foes. Bring it to the Gear Lock in time, or else you might get a visit from a not so friendly face. If you make it all the way to the world's boss, brace yourself for a tough fight. But wait, have you found all the secret items along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/97e1067d42cb3a2b91f803cee30728cf.poster.avif?t=1750869101\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/97e1067d42cb3a2b91f803cee30728cf.webm?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/97e1067d42cb3a2b91f803cee30728cf.mp4?t=1750869101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/472f1155a30424fc2897ed788e8fc6bc.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 worlds to explore  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 20 enemies to pummel  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 9 bosses to fight  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 endings to discover  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of powerups to collect   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of secrets to find   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate difficulties and game modes to unlock   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly hand drawn artwork and animation   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful and varied orchestral soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204480/extras/41526d0fc5c5ea5f137a654ed3d4ed16.avif?t=1750869101\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to dive into Wispy Dreams, a vibrant love letter to the classic arcade platformers of the 80s! Jump, collect power-ups, battle epic bosses, and unravel the secrets of the Wispy Isles in a beautifully hand-drawn adventure, whether you\u2019re playing solo or teaming up with a friend.",
